    "Held directory descriptors bind publication to the intended state directory; existing journal file data is synced before the parent directory on reuse."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Live NVMe identity/topology and interactive TTY authorization are replaced by explicit fixtures; separate policy/transaction tests cover those checks.",
