    "Only next-boot selection changes A to pending B to A. No running root switch, actual boot, failed-boot recovery, host rollback after reboot, power cut or KVM guest execution.",
    "Source checkout from git archive reuses previously authenticated package-state candidates; no immutable clean-builder or vendor-stack rebuild claim.",
